+//   one after the other). 7 of the session's 16 lookaheads that kicked anything handed exactly 7 or 8 pipelines: this cap, the draw at hand's own build counted. It kept
+//   every guess from queueing at the compiler service with the pipeline the frame waited for while every kick started at once; on the lanes a guess waits in the table, two
+//   compile at a time in draw order, and a pipeline a draw needs starts at once beside them (ppq_hurry_locked). Now, with the lanes on, the lookahead keeps up to RB_LOOK_AHEAD
